      "description": "Flag Trivia — Test Your World Knowledge\nHow well do you really know the world's flags? Flag Trivia turns geography into an addictive game, challenging you to identify flags from every country on Earth.\nWhether you're brushing up before a trip, sharpening your general knowledge, or just love a good quiz, Flag Trivia has something for every skill level — from casual player to geography expert.\nFeatures:\nHundreds of flags from countries across every continent\nMultiple difficulty levels, from beginner to expert\nDaily challenges to build your streak and stay sharp\nFun facts about each country to expand your knowledge\nClean, simple design that keeps the focus on the fun\nWhy Flag Trivia?\nIt's more than memorization — every round teaches you something new about the world. Compete against your own best scores, challenge friends, and see how many flags you can master.\nDownload Flag Trivia today and put your knowledge to the test!",
